{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/streams.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.729504Z","id":"980f4257b517a4f9de109de736d0da13aeeec4707cdbb942f508fc48af2a2b40","body":{"detail":"Under machine load this has failed with a new tab ready in 1121 ms against the 1000 ms budget. Functional tests should not judge time; the time-to-usable perf gate judges these, scaled to the machine.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":219},"end":{"line":221},"content_hash":"135a23af6a9a60674f0b8cd9042601413ba0379f4e4a0f93698f8f9a27d09033"},"suggested_fix":"Judge the test by the streams the daemon holds (one open stream at the same level, none opened for the new tabs or the publish) and log the times.","summary":"The thirty-tab stream test judges wall-clock budgets (a new tab ready within 1 s, publish-to-tab within 500 ms) and fails under load","tags":["flaky-test","fix-pending:followups-streams-perf-pi","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/streams.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.729542Z","id":"76c0610dd30031ed20e78da3f4e5f68c716ab3b97145f2a17398ebb716e52514","body":{"detail":"Seen once under load in a full gates run (2026-10-09). Two streams at the admin level may mean the artifact view reopened its stream after setName() although the daemon's caller had not changed, or a duplicate stream report. Not reproduced alone.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":164},"end":{"line":164},"content_hash":"f9436d8df90415588dac2b782f216cb960868f780ee32fcca960c799fe98ff81"},"summary":"The no-token stream test once saw stream levels [\"admin\",\"admin\"] where it expects [\"admin\"]","tags":["flaky-test","fix-pending:followups-streams-perf-pi","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/gesture.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731396Z","id":"2c771fe38d3d0645ca5e87c1cabe0466ddc9ecbf9298c9257e4b5441eabf38d7","body":{"detail":"Seen for the sandbox sendToClaude variant under heavy machine load; passed on rerun. The injected frame is now clicked only once it has loaded (this block). Not yet confirmed under a loaded full gates run.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1027},"end":{"line":1042},"content_hash":"3a7f1cf15235e08e3ec907d029ed896bbd38bd31a04b5d7a98beae53821c2cb1"},"summary":"The N14 closed-shadow-root case hit a 120 s timeout under load","tags":["flaky-test","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/subpages.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731434Z","id":"99e106564689907ff0dd6bc26b4241f7beaf7f48a38ba39c37d598e83e89fc8c","body":{"detail":"Passed 10 of 10 alone. Not yet diagnosed.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":171},"end":{"line":193},"content_hash":"62b35d2895462e57af1b55ea3a06b1e7b72ba95c453c781c1b3f1136140cf9ec"},"summary":"'one link inside the frame is one history entry' fails about 1 run in 120 under load","tags":["flaky-test","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/echo-chrome.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731541Z","id":"5cfcbebcab703a3b4870ddeea008d1500403828dff957097ffddfc90ef323a60","body":{"detail":"Passed 5 of 5 alone. Not yet diagnosed.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":440},"end":{"line":450},"content_hash":"4b2e54f93bea887975ed8ca10f6ce06c75a80510dc194e3dea17d29c3ddf1db6"},"summary":"'the artifact deleted while the viewer types in it leaves the keyboard free' took 6.2 min in one gates run","tags":["flaky-test","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/subpages.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731569Z","id":"3892dd574863e73cd63111b360ac40fe885eed924f1ddba6cef666c696d6b635","body":{"detail":"Seen 2026-10-05 at load 20 to 35; passed on rerun. Not yet diagnosed.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":95},"end":{"line":111},"content_hash":"d66d982e20004d984c2bbd7166ece797cfa1ebcb9014c4e2a6345c1c6e733f81"},"summary":"The fragment test's page URL check flakes under load","tags":["flaky-test","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/changelog.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731599Z","id":"1fb89fe2180e9ab019630a1a78c0b9f76ee918b2667200528bf8b5c7849a2206","body":{"detail":"Seen 2026-10-05 at load 20 to 35 at line 43; passed on rerun. Not yet diagnosed.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":23},"end":{"line":49},"content_hash":"d93e69430a460d0d729b834fd1892c1d2bfcc9d9a0ba9ac58cddbe3f0eddb23b"},"summary":".thread-pin.addressed not found within 5 s under load","tags":["flaky-test","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/streams.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:26:52.183659Z","id":"067e86b131a6604c662a4ddc88c5bbc8fb80134b3435996a6131e758c86fa1b9","body":{"detail":"This test checks that a publish reaches all 14 interested tabs within expect's 5 s timeout and logs the latencies; its former 500 ms bound was removed because wall-clock budgets in functional tests fail under load. The time-to-usable perf gate (web/perf) measures a tab's first paint and comment readiness, and scripts/perf-clients.py measures delivery to raw /api/stream clients, so delivery through the shared-worker hub to tabs is judged by no machine-scaled budget.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":279},"end":{"line":280},"content_hash":"88bb3bff31f4a493c95de0da980670497784345a77df890009cf86b3b9389241"},"suggested_fix":"Add a publish-to-tab delivery measure to the time-to-usable perf gate, scaled by its control like its other measures.","summary":"No gate judges how fast a publish reaches open tabs","tags":["review","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/streams.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:37:53.331008Z","id":"f222d027b2d6d615342a7bb566e8c4f72d207528e46980c8bc4af53dab32355a","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:7165f70","summary":"The thirty-tab test no longer judges wall-clock budgets: it asserts the daemon opened no stream for the new tabs or the publish (streams opened, from /api/_test/stream/open), that other artifacts' tabs neither heard the publish nor went live again, and that the publish reaches all 14 interested tabs within expect's timeout; times are logged only. web/e2e/streams.spec.ts 'thirty tabs share one stream; a new tab joins it, and a publish reaches every tab that wants it and no other' passes 3 of 3 runs (npx playwright test e2e/streams.spec.ts --project rest --repeat-each 3: 39 passed), and passed 24 of 24 runs beside four busy loops with new tabs taking up to 1741 ms.","supersedes":"980f4257b517a4f9de109de736d0da13aeeec4707cdbb942f508fc48af2a2b40","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/e2e/streams.spec.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:37:53.379068Z","id":"15eb52d946d3f4d01c78610de84ec28e068b72544a9b9d0970b97e02d438d36e","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:9a85e31","summary":"Cause: one rename was announced several times (the PUT and the presence event), and each tab reopened the shared stream for each; a stream request aborted before it answers stays open while Chrome drains it (about 5 s), so the daemon held two admin streams meanwhile. The hub now reopens only when the asked caller differs from the one the stream's ready names. web/e2e/streams.spec.ts: the owner's rename with 1, 2 or 3 tabs opens 0 streams and a LAN viewer's opens exactly 1 (3 of 3 runs each), and the late-token test opens exactly 1 stream at admin; web/shell/src/stream-hub.test.ts 'reopens once per caller however many tabs ask' passes.","supersedes":"76c0610dd30031ed20e78da3f4e5f68c716ab3b97145f2a17398ebb716e52514","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
